==German==

===Etymology===
From the notion that a person that cannot drive only uses their car on Sundays, to get out of town.

===Noun===
{{de-noun|g=m|Sonntagsfahrers|Sonntagsfahrer}}
'''[[Sonntagsfahrerin]]''' ''f''

# a person that drives badly, a [[Sunday driver]]

